That would be a blast, are you kidding?

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.623
I would love to be a contestant on there too.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.943
Yeah, we'll figure something out.

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:35.330
I just love to be in drag.

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:36.623
Yeah, Avenger's my dude.

00:10:37.732 --> 00:10:38.565
Yeah, bro.

00:10:38.565 --> 00:10:39.398
(laughing)

00:10:39.398 --> 00:10:40.231
Yeah, dude.

